  "description" : "This dataset includes information about New York State lead service lines, including service line materials, material identification methods, and service line installation dates.\n\nOn December 16, 2021, the federal Lead and Copper Rule Revisions (LCRR) went into effect, which requires every federally defined community and non-transient, non-community water system to develop a service line inventory and to make this information publicly available.\n\nIf you have any questions about your service line, please contact your water system. The public water system contact information can be found on your water bill or online at:\n<a href=https://health.ny.gov/environmental/water/drinking/pws_contacts/map_pws_contacts>https://health.ny.gov/environmental/water/drinking/pws_contacts/map_pws_contacts</a>",
