      "Disclaimers" : {
        "Limitations" : "The dataset includes information about service line materials that public water systems submitted to the New York State Department of Health. Some data fields may be marked unknown as of October 16, 2024, the deadline for submitting initial data. This is a multi-year effort to identify materials for all 4.7 million service lines in New York State. Public Health Law 1114-b requires all public water systems to submit updates annually, hence the dataset will be updated at the same frequency."
