      "Notes" : {
        "Notes" : "Public Health Law 1114-b mandates the New York State Department of Health to make all lead service line inventories submitted by public water systems available to the public through the Department’s website. Additionally, a summary of the inventories submitted to the Department of Health for each water system will be linked and published on the Department's public website."
